Loom: opt-in effect-order relaxations for hand-scheduled AIE2P bodies whose generator proves them
(LOOM_EXP_NOALIAS_ACC=2 vector loads vs stores, LOOM_EXP_NOWAR_ACC=1 accumulator stores vs loads,
LOOM_EXP_LOCK_ACQREL=6 lock acquire / release ordering). Unset: every order kept, emits byte-identical.
diff --git a/loom/src/loom/codegen/low/schedule/effect_dependencies.c b/loom/src/loom/codegen/low/schedule/effect_dependencies.c
--- a/loom/src/loom/codegen/low/schedule/effect_dependencies.c
+++ b/loom/src/loom/codegen/low/schedule/effect_dependencies.c
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
 
